      "end_time": 7.3,
      "text": "..."
    },
    {
      "index": 1,
      "start_time": 8.5,
      "end_time": 12.1,
      "text": "It's true that it feels cooler..."
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "start_time": 14.0,
      "end_time": 17.2,
      "text": "But isn't this just a swimsuit..."
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "start_time": 21.2,
      "end_time": 23.3,
      "text": "You two look good in those."
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "start_time": 23.6,
      "end_time": 24.6,
      "text": "Yeah..."
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "start_time": 25.3,
      "end_time": 26.6,
      "text": "Is that so?"
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "start_time": 26.8,
      "end_time": 30.0,
      "text": "I don't quite know how to respond to that..."
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "start_time": 31.5,
      "end_time": 33.6,
      "text": "T-That's enough about us!"
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "start_time": 33.8,
      "end_time": 36.1,
      "text": "Let's go meet the king as soon as possible!"
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "start_time": 36.3,
      "end_time": 38.3,
      "text": "Ah, that's a good idea!"
    },
    {
      "index": 10,
      "start_time": 38.6,
      "end_time": 39.6,
      "text": "Oh, wait!"
    },
    {
      "index": 11,
      "start_time": 40.2,
      "end_time": 41.2,
      "text": "..."
    },
    {
      "index": 12,
      "start_time": 49.5,
      "end_time": 51.5,
      "text": "What do you think about the desert country?"
    },
    {
      "index": 13,
      "start_time": 52.1,
      "end_time": 55.6,
      "text": "I'm really surprised there's a city like this at the edge of the desert."
    },
    {
      "index": 14,
      "start_time": 56.2,
      "end_time": 57.6,
      "text": "It seems like a good place, isn't it?"
    },
    {
      "index": 15,
      "start_time": 58.0,
      "end_time": 59.0,
      "text": "I agree with that."
    },
    {
      "index": 16,
      "start_time": 59.5,
      "end_time": 64.1,
      "text": "Also, let's have everyone continue pretending as married couples."
    },
    {
      "index": 17,
      "start_time": 64.3,
      "end_time": 65.5,
      "text": "You guys are fine with that, right?"
    },
    {
      "index": 18,
      "start_time": 69.3,
      "end_time": 71.1,
      "text": "As married couples..."
    },
    {
      "index": 19,
      "start_time": 73.4,
      "end_time": 75.6,
      "text": "Yes! Please don't forget about it."
    },
    {
      "index": 20,
      "start_time": 81.7,
      "end_time": 84.2,
      "text": "Is that so... I guess we are..."
    },
    {
      "index": 21,
      "start_time": 85.6,
      "end_time": 89.1,
      "text": "Just pretending... that we're married..."
    },
    {
      "index": 22,
      "start_time": 89.3,
      "end_time": 92.6,
      "text": "Well... I guess that's how it is..."
    },
    {
      "index": 23,
      "start_time": 93.0,
      "end_time": 94.4,
      "text": "Then let us go too."
    }
  ],
